sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant OP as Operator
  participant LAP as Air-gapped laptop
  participant YK as YubiKey PIV (PIN + touch)
  participant DEV as Target device
  participant VAL as Validator sidecar (mesh)

  Note over LAP,YK: Offline CA ceremony
  OP->>LAP: open ceremony, attach YubiKey
  OP->>LAP: enter PIN
  LAP->>YK: prepare bundle (peer key, ACL cap, 90d expiry)
  OP->>YK: physical TOUCH per signing
  YK->>LAP: Ed25519 signature
  LAP->>OP: signed CBOR bundle (.enr file)

  Note over OP,DEV: Out-of-band hand-off
  OP->>DEV: ship bundle with device

  Note over DEV,VAL: First-boot self-provisioning (no mgmt-plane reach)
  DEV->>VAL: present bundle
  VAL->>VAL: verify signature against root cert<br/>+ check expiry + check CRL
  VAL->>DEV: provision peer record into Spock
  DEV->>DEV: come up enrolled
